# SAP S/4HANA MM End-to-End Automotive Implementation Project\
**Company:** MRS Motors | **Location:** Pune (AU81) & Mumbai (AU82)\
\
An end-to-end Material Management (MM) implementation on SAP S/4HANA, covering Enterprise Structure definition, Master Data governance, Standard Procure-to-Pay (P2P), Subcontracting, Stock Transport Orders (STO), and Material Requirements Planning (MRP) automation.\
\
## \uc0\u55356 \u57314  1. Enterprise Structure & Assignments\
* **Company Code:** AU88 (MRS Motors Finance)\
* **Plant 1:** AU81 (Car Assembly Plant - Pune)\
* **Plant 2:** AU82 (Components Plant - Mumbai)\
* **Purchasing Organization:** AU88\
* **Cross-Module Integrations:** Configured custom Controlling Area (`AU88`) with active control indicators for Fiscal Year 2026 (`OKKP`).\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56522  2. Master Data Architecture\
* **Raw Materials (ROH):** Steel Sheets (`100002220`), Aluminium Ingots (`100002221`)\
* **Semi-Finished (HALB):** Automotive Tyres (`100002222`), 12V Batteries (`100002223`)\
* **Consumables (HIBE):** Engine Lubricant Oil (`100002224`)\
* **Suppliers Setup:** Created two distinct Business Partners (BP Role: `FLVN00` & `FLVN01`) mapped to G/L Trade Payables.\
\
